63    write(23, "# UserService API\n\nService for creating and retrieving users.\n\n## Create User\n\nCreates and persists a new user.\n\n### Request\n**Method:** POST\n**Path:** /api/v1/users\n\n| Field | Type   | Required | Description    |\n|-------|--------|----------|----------------|\n| name  | string | Yes      | Resource name  |\n\n### Response (201)\n```json\n{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }\n```\n\n### Errors\n| Code | Description    |\n|------|----------------|\n| 400  | Invalid input  |\n\n## Get User\n\nRetrieves a user by id.\n\n### Request\n**Method:** GET\n**Path:** /api/v1/users/{id}\n\n### Response (200)\n```json\n{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }\n```\n\n### Errors\n| Code | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| 404  | Not found   |\n", 713) = 713
