52    write(23, "# Sample Project\n\nA minimal example service used to exercise the `documentation` skill in a sandbox.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Prerequisites\n- Python 3.x\n\n### Installation\n```bash\ngit clone <repo>\ncd sample\n```\n\n### Usage\n```python\nfrom sample import UserService\n\nservice = UserService(repository)\nservice.create({\"name\": \"Test User\"})\n```\n\n## Configuration\nNo configuration required for the sample.\n\n## Contributing\nOpen a pull request with documentation updates.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class UserService {\n        +create(command) UserDto\n        +find_by_id(id) UserDto\n    }\n    class UserRepository {\n        <<interface>>\n        +save(user) User\n        +find_by_id(id) User\n    }\n    UserService --> UserRepository\n```\n", 745) = 745
